.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4915640-1846018067932813","game_id":"steam-4915640","kind":"update","title":"Log Drop Demo Update v0.1.5","summary":"I've been blown away by how many people are enjoying the Log Drop demo, its been a wild past week since the demo came out, with over 25,000 people having played, and somehow reaching 600 peak concurrent users :oThanks to everyone engaging and leaving feedback across the various channels - I try to answer as much as i can! This update is primarily quality of life improvements formed mostly from all the feedback you've been giving.NewTool Snapping - hold Alt (Option on Mac) while placing or moving","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T10:14:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067932813","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4915640-1845383656377412","game_id":"steam-4915640","kind":"announcement","title":"Log Drop Demo is Live!","summary":"The Log Drop demo is out v0.1.4The core is hungry. Feed it. What's in the demo: a campaign where every zone is its own puzzle with its own objectives. 5 zones plus 1 bonus zone past the tutorial, roughly 40 min to 1 hr+.New stuff since playtest- The Void: a bonus zone with a new mechanic that unlocks after the last demo zone.- Stats panel: per-zone records, run totals and clear times, for the speedrunners (if there are any out there!)- Readable font option under a new Accessibility tab, if pixel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:26:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377412","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:48:33Z","